6186
05:25:38,430 --> 05:25:41,330
This ghost right here is doing insane work.

6187
05:25:46,860 --> 05:25:48,760
It's time to blue flame the mineral line again.

6188
05:25:50,120 --> 05:25:51,620
Look at that! 42, that was a crit!

6189
