6236
05:28:16,840 --> 05:28:19,620
Dude, this game is pretty cool.

6237
05:28:21,160 --> 05:28:24,480
In fact, I spent way more time today than I initially planned to do.

6238
05:28:27,530 --> 05:28:29,850
This was supposed to be between three and four hours.

6239
05:28:30,050 --> 05:28:30,510
