6256
05:28:58,760 --> 05:28:59,520
Look at that.

6257
05:29:00,880 --> 05:29:02,020
Isn't that cool or what?

6258
05:29:08,920 --> 05:29:10,200
How are you doing, people?

6259
05:29:12,720 --> 05:29:13,960
Five yards centipede.

6260
05:29:15,020 --> 05:29:15,740
