6276
05:29:53,050 --> 05:29:53,550
Five euros.

6277
05:29:53,750 --> 05:29:54,170
Thank you, man.

6278
05:29:54,790 --> 05:29:56,310
I like your profile picture, by the way.

6279
05:29:56,690 --> 05:29:57,570
