6280
05:29:58,090 --> 05:29:59,130
Hello to the end of the stream.

6281
05:29:59,350 --> 05:30:00,430
You're cooking really good.

6282
05:30:00,930 --> 05:30:03,150
It's going to be one of the best playthrough starts I've seen.

6283
05:30:03,310 --> 05:30:04,450
Very excited for the series.

6284
05:30:05,250 --> 05:30:07,110
