6290
05:30:19,790 --> 05:30:20,250
Nice.

6291
05:30:20,650 --> 05:30:23,310
Potat, you have now achieved a triangle status.

6292
05:30:24,010 --> 05:30:26,030
Much better than a straight line, you know?

6293
05:30:26,930 --> 05:30:28,150
So, welcome.

6294
05:30:28,850 --> 05:30:29,130
Again.

6295
05:30:30,330 --> 05:30:31,070
The Oolun.

6296
05:30:31,830 --> 05:30:33,030
Thanks for the two pounds, man.

6297
05:30:33,170 --> 05:30:33,530
Hi, chat.

6298
05:30:34,290 --> 05:30:34,970
Hi, Oolun.

6299
05:30:35,110 --> 05:30:36,050
I like your profile picture.

6300
05:30:36,570 --> 05:30:39,150
Reminds me of something from Hollow Knight.

6301
05:30:40,750 --> 05:30:43,090
Ludwig, you gifted five memberships to people.

6302
05:30:44,430 --> 05:30:45,370
Thank you, man.

6303
05:30:46,650 --> 05:30:47,510
Who are the lucky ones?

6304
05:30:49,650 --> 05:30:51,630
I do wonder if you're able to choose as well,

6305
05:30:51,650 --> 05:30:52,890
