6306
05:30:58,210 --> 05:30:58,810
Let's see.

6307
05:31:00,050 --> 05:31:00,630
That's awesome.

6308
05:31:00,870 --> 05:31:03,930
Ludwig, thanks for hanging out and watching the stream

6309
05:31:03,930 --> 05:31:04,870
