6310
05:31:05,430 --> 05:31:05,950
That's awesome.

6311
05:31:07,650 --> 05:31:08,090
Elavi.

6312
05:31:09,050 --> 05:31:10,670
Thank you for the 10 euros, man.

6313
05:31:10,670 --> 05:31:13,690
Even in the darkest of times, let this knowledge

6314
05:31:13,690 --> 05:31:14,970
