6315
05:31:15,410 --> 05:31:16,650
This is just a kids' game.

6316
05:31:16,770 --> 05:31:17,870
How hard can it be?

6317
05:31:20,570 --> 05:31:21,970
All right, all right, all right.

6318
05:31:22,670 --> 05:31:23,530
You can laugh.

6319
05:31:24,270 --> 05:31:25,670
Okay, that was maybe...

6320
05:31:26,630 --> 05:31:27,030
Yeah.

6321
05:31:27,630 --> 05:31:28,930
That didn't age well, did it?

6322
05:31:30,310 --> 05:31:31,090
But you know what?

6323
05:31:31,550 --> 05:31:32,410
It's gotten better.

6324
05:31:32,530 --> 05:31:33,550
The beginning was rough, you know?

6325
05:31:33,650 --> 05:31:36,850
I feel like I got into a bad circle there at the beginning.

6326
05:31:37,990 --> 05:31:39,210
But it turned out all right.

6327
05:31:40,910 --> 05:31:43,370
Hello, future Oliver, whenever you read your donuts.

6328
05:31:44,250 --> 05:31:45,410
Hey, the Olon again.

6329
05:31:46,330 --> 05:31:47,510
With the extra one cent.

6330
05:31:47,730 --> 05:31:48,210
I love it.

6331
05:31:48,550 --> 05:31:49,070
Thanks, man.

6332
05:31:50,210 --> 05:31:53,370
And hey, past the Olon or the Ulun.

6333
05:31:54,590 --> 05:31:56,010
I don't actually know how to pronounce your name.

6334
05:31:56,130 --> 05:31:56,410
