6335
05:31:59,970 --> 05:32:00,770
Sergei Svikolnikov.

6336
05:32:01,810 --> 05:32:03,150
I feel like I nailed that name first try.

6337
05:32:03,750 --> 05:32:04,530
Tell me if I did or not.

6338
05:32:05,010 --> 05:32:05,770
Thanks for the five euros.

6339
05:32:06,050 --> 05:32:08,530
Hey, Oliver, I recall you enjoyed Subnautica.

6340
05:32:08,530 --> 05:32:11,410
I would recommend you give a try to Grounded.

6341
05:32:12,130 --> 05:32:14,850
Very similar vibe in terms of exploration and progression.

6342
05:32:15,650 --> 05:32:19,930
So I actually did play a little bit of Grounded with one of my real life friends.

6343
05:32:20,110 --> 05:32:22,350
We played for like, I'm gonna say an hour.

6344
05:32:24,070 --> 05:32:28,050
But there were some spiders in that game that fucked me up.

6345
05:32:29,850 --> 05:32:31,350
I'm not sure I can play that game.

6346
05:32:32,070 --> 05:32:36,150
The spiders in that game are way too realistic and they mess with me.

6347
05:32:36,150 --> 05:32:38,450
That was rough.

6348
05:32:40,330 --> 05:32:41,230
Scary stuff.

6349
05:32:42,130 --> 05:32:44,890
But it seems like a solid game when I played it.

6350
05:32:45,170 --> 05:32:46,390
It seemed like a really fun game.

6351
05:32:47,590 --> 05:32:49,690
Yeah, it's a solid suggestion for sure.

6352
05:32:49,870 --> 05:32:51,150
Thanks Sergei.

6353
05:32:52,730 --> 05:32:53,350
The Ulun.

6354
05:32:53,950 --> 05:32:55,490
I enjoyed watching very long stream.

6355
05:32:55,710 --> 05:32:57,250
Yes, five and a half hours.

6356
05:32:57,410 --> 05:33:00,810
But I guess the first 30 minutes were the countdown and all that.

6357
05:33:01,130 --> 05:33:02,930
So five hours is indeed a long stream.

6358
05:33:03,050 --> 05:33:04,130
It's not something I'm used to doing.

6359
05:33:04,130 --> 05:33:07,710
I have done some in the past that were five hours.

6360
05:33:08,570 --> 05:33:10,570
Usually it's when I forget time, like today.

6361
