6367
05:33:25,910 --> 05:33:26,650
Did you change your name?

6368
05:33:27,130 --> 05:33:28,570
Am I tripping right now?

6369
05:33:29,930 --> 05:33:32,550
Did I dream saying this or something?

6370
05:33:33,650 --> 05:33:35,670
Terraria is a great game. I hope you enjoy it.

6371
05:33:36,550 --> 05:33:37,230
It is.

6372
05:33:38,030 --> 05:33:38,950
So far it's fun.

6373
05:33:39,710 --> 05:33:43,030
I gotta say it's more fun than I was expecting.

6374
05:33:44,630 --> 05:33:47,050
I was a little bit, you know, in the beginning.

6375
05:33:47,430 --> 05:33:49,850
I mean, I did see some screenshots on Steam of the game.

6376
05:33:50,650 --> 05:33:51,730
And I looked at it.

6377
05:33:52,450 --> 05:33:53,690
I don't know man.

6378
05:33:54,150 --> 05:33:55,690
I don't know if this is gonna be for me.

6379
05:33:56,470 --> 05:33:59,230
But I gotta say it's super fun so far.

6380
05:33:59,410 --> 05:34:01,130
And I'm excited to play more of it.

6381
05:34:01,130 --> 05:34:02,590
So there it is.

6382
05:34:04,250 --> 05:34:05,330
It is a great game.

6383
05:34:06,010 --> 05:34:08,090
And Darth clone has joined the can.

6384
05:34:08,750 --> 05:34:10,490
You have achieved a straight line so far?

6385
05:34:11,050 --> 05:34:11,590
Welcome man.

6386
05:34:12,030 --> 05:34:13,730
Welcome to the can. That's really nice of you.

6387
05:34:14,310 --> 05:34:14,530
Welcome.

6388
05:34:15,530 --> 05:34:16,670
How's everybody else doing?

6389
05:34:18,510 --> 05:34:19,290
Did you enjoy the stream?

6390
05:34:21,810 --> 05:34:24,370
You called me Ethan squared once and I guess it stuck.

6391
05:34:24,570 --> 05:34:26,170
Wait, your name was always Ethan cubed?

6392
05:34:27,690 --> 05:34:28,450
No way.

6393
05:34:31,760 --> 05:34:35,260
All we're doing stream, the stream chat was covering the terrarium messages.

6394
05:34:35,540 --> 05:34:36,840
Oh, okay, okay.

6395
05:34:37,320 --> 05:34:39,720
Thanks for pointing that out debonair puma.

6396
05:34:40,160 --> 05:34:42,180
I'm gonna check up on that for next time.

6397
05:34:43,080 --> 05:34:44,320
Also, I kind of forgot.

6398
05:34:44,500 --> 05:34:46,560
I needed to check in with you after 30 minutes.

6399
05:34:47,160 --> 05:34:49,680
Regarding the audio, I hope it was fine during the game.

6400
05:34:50,380 --> 05:34:52,800
I completely forgot about that.

6401
05:34:52,900 --> 05:34:53,220
I'm sorry.

6402
05:34:53,780 --> 05:34:55,740
I was totally into the game.

6403
05:34:57,340 --> 05:34:59,060
I got sucked in, man.

6404
05:35:03,580 --> 05:35:05,120
Yashir Russel or Russell.

6405
05:35:05,780 --> 05:35:09,120
Thanks for showing it two days before we started because of that I finally caught one.

6406
05:35:10,520 --> 05:35:11,480
Oh, yeah.

6407
05:35:12,200 --> 05:35:14,580
Yeah, I'm sorry. I don't do that as much.

6408
05:35:15,140 --> 05:35:17,360
It's simply because I have such a tight schedule

6409
05:35:18,180 --> 05:35:20,600
