6414
05:35:42,650 --> 05:35:44,190
Hey, Doc Hatter. Bye-bye, Oliver.

6415
05:35:44,370 --> 05:35:46,810
I don't know if this request got lost in the sea of others last time,

6416
05:35:46,830 --> 05:35:49,270
but if you enjoy inscription when you give that a go,

6417
05:35:49,430 --> 05:35:50,450
I'd like to also recommend

6418
05:35:51,390 --> 05:35:52,930
Hieronymus Bosch's Brutal Orchestra.

6419
05:35:54,570 --> 05:35:55,150
Hold on.

6420
05:35:55,970 --> 05:35:56,730
Hieronymus Bosch.

6421
05:35:57,330 --> 05:36:00,050
