05:47:54,510 --> 05:47:55,810
Wait a minute. Timu.

6678
05:47:56,770 --> 05:47:59,150
Isn't your name based on some kind of...

6679
05:48:00,450 --> 05:48:01,870
character in Dota?

6680
05:48:02,970 --> 05:48:04,090
Or is it League of Legends?

6681
05:48:05,130 --> 05:48:06,750
Or maybe I'm misremembering here.

6682
05:48:10,410 --> 05:48:13,130
Singapore. Oh, hello, Barry. Welcome.

6683
05:48:14,310 --> 05:48:15,050
Welcome, welcome.

6684
05:48:15,830 --> 05:48:16,510
Nice to have you.

6685
05:48:17,990 --> 05:48:19,490
Singaporean Dollar. Oh!

6686
05:48:19,990 --> 05:48:20,650
That makes sense.

6687
05:48:22,550 --> 05:48:23,810
SGD, Singaporean Dollar.

6688
05:48:24,310 --> 05:48:24,690
Cool.

6689
05:48:27,410 --> 05:48:28,690
Hadi the Holy Wolf.

6690
05:48:29,450 --> 05:48:29,930
$50.

6691
05:48:31,610 --> 05:48:33,010
Wow, thank you so much.

6692
05:48:33,170 --> 05:48:35,190
Hope your Terraria experience has been pleasant so far.

6693
05:48:36,150 --> 05:48:38,290
It's been amazing so far, Hadi.

6694
05:48:39,110 --> 05:48:41,730
I don't know if you've seen the stream or if you just joined,

6695
05:48:41,870 --> 05:48:44,190
but I've been having a blast with this game.

6696
05:48:45,130 --> 05:48:46,170
It's super fun.

6697
05:48:47,770 --> 05:48:49,810
I especially... you know what I love the most?

6698
05:48:50,970 --> 05:48:53,030
Today, in this game is...

6699
05:48:53,030 --> 05:48:54,650
when I found that maze.

6700
05:48:55,830 --> 05:48:57,010
The maze on a string.

6701
05:48:57,990 --> 05:49:00,070
It's the best way. You know the one you swing?

6702
05:49:01,030 --> 05:49:03,050
That was such a great,

6703
05:49:03,570 --> 05:49:04,370
progressional upgrade.

6704
05:49:05,450 --> 05:49:07,550
And God, it felt good to get that item.

6705
05:49:08,270 --> 05:49:09,890
You know, when I got that item,

6706
05:49:09,970 --> 05:49:11,210
the game was sort of like...

6707
05:49:11,210 --> 05:49:12,590
that's when it sort of clicked for me a little.

6708
05:49:13,450 --> 05:49:15,570
I was like, okay, okay, okay, here we go.

6709
05:49:16,310 --> 05:49:17,970
You know? Thank you so much, Hadi.

6710
05:49:17,970 --> 05:49:19,510
That's very generous of you.

6711
05:49:21,570 --> 05:49:22,430
Milano chocolate.

6712
05:49:23,150 --> 05:49:26,290
Is that a Discord icon with...

6713
05:49:26,290 --> 05:49:28,630
I can't even tell from here. It's so small.

6714
05:49:29,330 --> 05:49:31,090
But like one of those meme eyes, I don't know.

6715
05:49:31,210 --> 05:49:31,930
Thanks for the dollar, man.

6716
05:49:32,870 --> 05:49:33,710
Thank you so much.

6717
05:49:37,780 --> 05:49:39,300
It's a regular Finnish name.

6718
05:49:39,500 --> 05:49:40,700
Oh, shit, really?

6719
05:49:41,340 --> 05:49:41,780
Teemo.

6720
05:49:45,510 --> 05:49:46,750
Oh, I see.

6721
05:49:49,010 --> 05:49:50,270
But I get that often?

6722
05:49:50,270 --> 05:49:52,210
Oh, okay. That makes me feel better.

6723
05:49:52,710 --> 05:49:53,890
I'm sorry, Teemo.

6724
05:49:56,070 --> 05:49:57,790
I'm just curious here now.

6725
05:49:57,950 --> 05:49:58,910
So you're from Finland, right?

6726
05:50:00,070 --> 05:50:02,510
Has the average Finlandian

6727
05:50:02,510 --> 05:50:05,070
or Finnish person heard of Serral?

6728
05:50:07,510 --> 05:50:08,590
I'm not going to say more.

6729
05:50:09,110 --> 05:50:11,050
Does that name ring any bells to you at all?

6730
05:50:11,190 --> 05:50:12,430
Is he sort of famous in your country?

6731
05:50:13,150 --> 05:50:13,530
Serral?

6732
05:50:15,650 --> 05:50:17,750
Serral, maybe the way you pronounce it?

6733
05:50:17,750 --> 05:50:18,210
I'm not sure.

6734
05:50:20,850 --> 05:50:21,710
Probably not.

6735
05:50:24,900 --> 05:50:28,500
Because that's what I think of when I hear Finland lately.

6736
05:50:32,880 --> 05:50:34,340
Isn't Serral the Starcraft 2 pro?

6737
05:50:34,560 --> 05:50:35,520
Yes, he is.

6738
05:50:36,380 --> 05:50:39,240
He's probably the best player in the world at Starcraft 2.

6739
05:50:39,900 --> 05:50:41,120
Even better than the Koreans.

6740
05:50:42,700 --> 05:50:43,420
He's amazing.

6741
05:50:45,580 --> 05:50:47,540
I've been following him for so many years

6742
05:50:47,540 --> 05:50:48,760
and it's just a pleasure.

6743
05:50:51,080 --> 05:50:52,820
However, if you stream for 10 more minutes,

6744
05:50:52,960 --> 05:50:55,860
the length will be 6 hours including the timer and downtime though.

6745
05:50:57,500 --> 05:50:58,320
Actually, you're right.

6746
05:51:01,260 --> 05:51:02,660
Is that a record for me then?

6747
05:51:04,140 --> 05:51:05,180
Here's the crazy thing.

6748
05:51:05,540 --> 05:51:08,040
I know people on Twitch stream like 10 hours every day.

6749
05:51:08,180 --> 05:51:09,240
How the fuck do you do that?

6750
05:51:10,620 --> 05:51:11,380
That's insane.

6751
05:51:11,800 --> 05:51:13,440
I feel like...

6752
05:51:13,840 --> 05:51:15,920
I got sucked into the game right now, right?

6753
05:51:16,000 --> 05:51:16,820
And I forgot about time.

6754
05:51:16,820 --> 05:51:20,820
But 6 hours is quite a long time, isn't it?

6755
05:51:24,100 --> 05:51:26,100
My main association with Finland is Control.

6756
05:51:26,680 --> 05:51:28,720
Oh, it's the Finnish company that made that.

6757
05:51:31,180 --> 05:51:31,780
Cool.

6758
05:51:32,700 --> 05:51:38,580
I heard Serral was legendary years.

6759
05:51:40,760 --> 05:51:42,780
And he's so nonchalant about it too.

6760
05:51:43,240 --> 05:51:43,900
It's really nice.

6761
05:51:45,800 --> 05:51:49,400
He wins the entire tournament and drops a single map

6762
05:51:49,400 --> 05:51:51,360
and then stands on the podium and is like,

6763
05:51:51,460 --> 05:51:52,660
yeah, it was very good.

6764
05:51:52,920 --> 05:51:53,880
I played well.

6765
05:51:54,800 --> 05:51:57,100
Thanks, guys. And then he's off, you know?

6766
05:51:57,460 --> 05:51:59,180
I love him.

6767
05:51:59,720 --> 05:52:00,360
It's so cool.

6768
05:52:02,420 --> 05:52:04,240
How about a 24-hour stream?

6769
05:52:04,480 --> 05:52:07,240
If that has to happen, there would be breaks, I guess.

6770
05:52:07,480 --> 05:52:09,600
Eating breaks and bio breaks and all that.

6771
05:52:09,960 --> 05:52:13,760
In fact, I'm surprised I didn't need to go to the bathroom once during this.

6772
05:52:13,800 --> 05:52:15,080
This is very unusual for me.

6773
05:52:18,480 --> 05:52:19,320
Very unusual.

6774
05:52:23,650 --> 05:52:24,850
Kukukatsu, I love your name.

6775
05:52:25,330 --> 05:52:26,990
I just love that name, Kukukatsu.

6776
05:52:27,830 --> 05:52:29,110
Or maybe I pronounced it wrong.

6777
05:52:30,750 --> 05:52:32,830
Some people stream themselves sleeping though I've heard.

6778
05:52:33,190 --> 05:52:34,650
Yeah, I've heard about that too.

6779
05:52:37,560 --> 05:52:39,280
You have the guys behind Max Payne.

6780
05:52:39,360 --> 05:52:40,440
I've actually never played that.

6781
05:52:42,760 --> 05:52:44,240
It's an old game, isn't it?

6782
05:52:46,820 --> 05:52:48,840
By the way, Oliver, you might want to check out Noida.

6783
05:52:49,080 --> 05:52:50,780
I know Noida is made by Finnish people too.

6784
05:52:54,230 --> 05:52:56,070
And Noida is on my list for sure.

6785
05:52:56,270 --> 05:52:58,030
It was actually a bit...

6786
05:52:58,030 --> 05:53:03,650
I was questioning whether to do Noida or Terraria this time around for streams.

6787
05:53:03,850 --> 05:53:05,030
So it was actually between those two.

6788
05:53:08,520 --> 05:53:10,920
I have a question. Who wrote the short description for this stream?

6789
05:53:11,060 --> 05:53:12,360
I've been wondering for the whole stream.

6790
05:53:12,640 --> 05:53:13,320
Just AI.

6791
05:53:14,820 --> 05:53:17,300
Because I usually don't know what to write there.

6792
05:53:17,400 --> 05:53:19,580
So I just go to chat cheaply and be like...

6793
05:53:20,100 --> 05:53:23,460
Write a short summary of Terraria or something.

6794
05:53:23,860 --> 05:53:26,460
And then it does it, and I usually write it without spoilers, you know?

6795
05:53:26,780 --> 05:53:28,260
So it tries to make it as vague as possible.

6796
05:53:29,100 --> 05:53:30,240
And that's just what I put in.

6797
05:53:31,540 --> 05:53:34,460
It's just for people who don't know about...

6798
05:53:35,100 --> 05:53:36,500
What the game is about, you know?

6799
05:53:37,420 --> 05:53:40,680
But I guess I could also just go on Steam and copy-paste the description there.

6800
05:53:40,720 --> 05:53:41,740
That would probably be easier.

6801
05:53:46,190 --> 05:53:46,910
AI description.

6802
05:53:47,550 --> 05:53:50,210
In fact, guys, this whole stream has been AI. I'm so sorry.

6803
05:53:51,130 --> 05:53:52,430
I'm not even real, dude.

6804
05:53:53,950 --> 05:53:58,070
This has been brought to you by the power of artificial intelligence.

6805
05:54:03,080 --> 05:54:07,300
Nah, I feel like an AI wouldn't struggle that much in the beginning of the game.

6806
05:54:08,340 --> 05:54:08,900
That's... yeah.

6807
05:54:10,860 --> 05:54:12,380
AI Oliver's sad face.

6808
05:54:16,630 --> 05:54:20,970
You could include some instructions for no back-seeding or stuff in the description, too.

6809
05:54:21,110 --> 05:54:23,770
Guys, I feel like it's not even necessary. You guys have been awesome.

6810
05:54:24,290 --> 05:54:26,030
Nobody's spoiling anything in the chat.

6811
05:54:26,030 --> 05:54:29,430
And I mean, I'm not looking at the chat while I'm playing.

6812
05:54:29,670 --> 05:54:34,590
I feel like, and if there's any spoilers at all, there's usually a mod that will take care of it.

6813
05:54:35,670 --> 05:54:38,090
It's... I don't know. I feel like we have such a great community here.

6814
05:54:38,870 --> 05:54:40,430
People... people just know.

6815
05:54:41,430 --> 05:54:42,130
It's awesome.

6816
05:54:43,890 --> 05:54:47,250
But yeah, I should probably write a little sentence there just saying, you know?

6817
05:54:48,730 --> 05:54:50,830
You are strongly self-moderating.

6818
05:54:51,310 --> 05:54:52,130
And it's awesome.

6819
05:54:54,730 --> 05:54:57,930
Yeah, but new viewers won't know to not back-seed. That's true.

6820
05:54:59,450 --> 05:55:04,890
Yeah, I should definitely throw in a short explanation there in the description.

6821
05:55:06,570 --> 05:55:11,010
But I actually found out recently that not a lot of people realize what back-seeding means.

6822
05:55:11,930 --> 05:55:14,810
So that's why I didn't put it in the title of this video like I did with Minecraft.

6823
05:55:15,630 --> 05:55:18,010
So many people always ask, what does back-seeding mean?

6824
05:55:18,010 --> 05:55:22,790
Or maybe they have different interpretations of what constitutes back-seeding.

6825
05:55:28,670 --> 05:55:32,170
Aorta, they're not looking at chat during game. It's such a cool way of doing it.

6826
05:55:32,570 --> 05:55:35,170
We get all the spoilers out of our system when you're not looking.

6827
05:55:35,730 --> 05:55:41,070
Yeah, and I think it's sort of funny knowing that you guys are arguing between yourselves or...

6828
05:55:41,910 --> 05:55:46,090
Yeah, I don't know. It's like watching...

6829
05:55:46,090 --> 05:55:48,390
So I don't watch football, but I can imagine.

6830
05:55:48,390 --> 05:55:52,350
This is how it is. People sit down on a couch and watch football and they're just like,

6831
05:55:52,390 --> 05:55:54,950
Come on, you asshole! Fucking get the ball in there, you know?

6832
05:55:55,490 --> 05:55:58,670
Same kind of energy, I imagine. In a weird way.

6833
05:56:00,010 --> 05:56:01,530
And that just sounds fun.

6834
05:56:04,230 --> 05:56:07,030
You should have a giant red alarm siren pop up.

6835
05:56:08,130 --> 05:56:09,050
Don't back-seed!

6836
05:56:10,730 --> 05:56:11,770
I don't know about that.

6837
05:56:18,620 --> 05:56:20,880
Oh, the chaos in chat at times, Alexander?

6838
05:56:28,990 --> 05:56:30,350
He's exactly like that, Oliver.

6839
05:56:31,950 --> 05:56:34,690
That's awesome, Ghost. That's what I expect.

6840
05:56:39,510 --> 05:56:41,090
More supportive, but yeah, pretty much.

6841
05:56:41,610 --> 05:56:45,790
Okay, that's nice. I mean, you can say whatever you want.

6842
05:56:45,930 --> 05:56:46,750
I mean, it's all fun.

6843
05:56:48,590 --> 05:56:50,210
Come on, Oliver, put the door down!

6844
05:56:51,650 --> 05:56:53,470
The door! No, the door!

6845
05:56:56,450 --> 05:56:59,250
You get an in-game back-seater in this game, though. Damn, Joe.

6846
05:56:59,850 --> 05:57:03,470
I like Joe. You can't knock on Joe. Joe is great.

6847
05:57:06,010 --> 05:57:08,350
30 more minutes and this will be the longest stream so far.

6848
05:57:08,490 --> 05:57:10,910
Oh, really? So I have done more than this before.

6849
05:57:12,230 --> 05:57:14,550
I wonder which game that was. Must have been Minecraft.

6850
05:57:16,190 --> 05:57:18,570
It could also be Rain World. I did one long stream, I remember.

6851
05:57:26,300 --> 05:57:29,420
Just caught up with everything I missed. Hey, Obesity, how you doing?

6852
05:57:30,740 --> 05:57:34,800
There's something about your name, Obesity, and then just random picture of Mario.

6853
05:57:35,620 --> 05:57:37,100
It's just funny to me.

6854
05:57:39,320 --> 05:57:42,360
Diego, how you doing? Chat telepathy?

6855
05:57:43,880 --> 05:57:48,140
What do you mean? That one Minecraft stream was weirdly long.

6856
05:57:48,300 --> 05:57:53,260
Oh, okay, yeah. Oh, that was probably the New Year's stream, wasn't it?

6857
05:57:53,680 --> 05:57:57,560
Where I was drinking. Yeah, I totally forgot time in that one.

6858
05:58:03,920 --> 05:58:05,100
Justice for Maxwell.

6859
05:58:05,100 --> 05:58:08,440
Well, I mean, what happened to it?

6860
05:58:08,980 --> 05:58:12,460
Some new guy just came in and replaced Maxwell and now his name was Joe.

6861
05:58:13,260 --> 05:58:16,260
That was very odd. I thought he would just respawn.

6862
05:58:16,560 --> 05:58:19,340
I mean, he did, I guess, but as a reincarnated new person.

6863
05:58:20,080 --> 05:58:22,460
It was a bit weird. Big Mario.

6864
05:58:27,500 --> 05:58:29,200
He doesn't know about chat telepathy?

6865
05:58:31,560 --> 05:58:37,950
What is that? Or don't tell me.

6866
05:58:37,950 --> 05:58:40,550
No, don't tell him. Okay, maybe don't tell me then.

6867
05:58:42,030 --> 05:58:46,210
I don't know what it is. He does not know what that is and it's not supposed to.

6868
05:58:46,290 --> 05:58:49,210
Okay, you know what? It's my cue to get out of here anyway.

6869
05:58:50,330 --> 05:58:53,010
Guys, thank you so much for watching. This has been a goddamn blast!

6870
05:58:54,090 --> 05:58:58,690
I had so much fun with this. And it's cool to know that so many people enjoyed watching this, too.

6871
05:59:00,090 --> 05:59:01,870
So, I say to you now,

6872
05:59:04,450 --> 05:59:05,770
enjoy your Easter Day

6873
05:59:06,550 --> 05:59:08,850
or the rest of it, depending on where you are.

6874
05:59:10,130 --> 05:59:14,830
And yeah, I'm gonna be out of here. I'll be playing this game again soon.

6875
05:59:15,430 --> 05:59:17,250
Thanks for watching. You guys are the best.

6876
05:59:17,610 --> 05:59:20,370
Join the Discord. Hang out with the people.

6877
05:59:21,310 --> 05:59:25,190
And I'll see you around, okay? Have a good one! Adios!

